<title>INDIA: India Tata Infotech jumps ahead of bonus.</title>
<headline>India Tata Infotech jumps ahead of bonus.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Tata Infotech --formerly called Tata Unisys Ltd -- jumped 89.0 rupees or nearly ten percent, to 1,000.0 on Tuesday as speculators bid the stock ahead of a bonus share announcement, traders said.</p>
<p>Tata Infotech's gains came on the back of a 10 percent jump on Monday.  </p>
<p>The company on Saturday said its board of directors will meet on June 13 to finalise a bonus issue of shares. The board will also announce financial results for the year ending March 31, 1997 and declare a dividend on that day.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
